            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 495992,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Following up on our layout discussion, I've drafted the first set of modular cabinet designs and put them in A2. This covers standard base, wall, and tall units for the three layouts. Please review for T2.",
