                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 506532,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Looks clean. The joinery is simple, which is good for our machines. I can start generating the cut lists from this right away. While we're at it, let's tackle T4 and pick some finishes. I propose we use our top two sellers: 'Alpine White' and 'Cloud White', plus 'Steel Grey' for an accent. I can write up the process in A4.",
