            "speaker_id": 506532,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Alright team, the final cut lists from A2 are ready. I'm starting the prototype build (T3) now, beginning with the base cabinets. Who can jump on the wall and tall units?",
            "mentions": [
              45878,
